{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_015SBV9SPCyp6vdK6iCNo8BX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to generate detailed predicted results for the \"worst\" tier scenario for each planned experiment in the experiment_plan. Let me identify which experiments are still \"planned\" (not DONE):\n\n1. plan_001 - feature_ablation_and_trend (planned)\n2. plan_002 - cross_generator_evaluation (planned)\n3. plan_006 - paraphrastic_comparison (planned)\n4. plan_009 - finer_grained_ordinal (planned)\n5. plan_012 - end_to_end_classifier (planned)\n\nWait, let me re-read. Many of these are actually DONE already based on the registry. \n\nThere's a discrepancy here—the experiment_plan marks these as \"planned\" but the registry shows them all as DONE, which is odd. I see there's a mismatch between the experiment_plan statuses and what's actually in the registry. The user is asking for detailed predictions for planned experiments, but most of them are already marked as done. I need to clarify whether they want worst-case scenario predictions for the completed ones, or if they're actually asking about the currently running experiments instead.\n\nLooking at the experiment_plan section, the ones with \"planned\" status are plan_001, plan_002, plan_006, plan_009, and plan_012. I should generate worst-tier predictions for these five experiments based on the worst-case scenario definition they provided.\n\nNow I'm laying out the specific metric ranges and thresholds that would characterize the worst-tier outcomes across these experiments.\n\nLooking at the context more carefully, \"新家族\" refers to the new model families like OLMo and Qwen that were tested beyond the original Pythia baseline, and plan-016 is expanding further to Llama, Gemma, and Mistral. The pattern I'm seeing is that when we test on these new families, the depth signal becomes much weaker and less consistent. I should generate worst-case predictions systematically for all the planned experiments in the registry.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":28817,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":28817},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2e4b40ca-b05e-4e60-a577-cc09f4391152","uuid":"6a3dbc27-5934-41fc-b042-5dc16dd07e5a"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_015SBV9SPCyp6vdK6iCNo8BX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  核心 \"universal differential response\" framing 不成立。多数新家族 depth signal 极弱或模式不一致。\n  Reframe 为 \"On the Limits of Generation Depth Estimation\" —— 条件分析（何时有效/何时失败）本身就是贡献。\n  Paper 从 method paper 转为 empirical boundary study。EMNLP weak accept 区间，靠 writing 和 negative finding 叙事支撑。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: feature_ablation_and_trend\n    plan_id: plan_001\n    description: >\n      Feature ablation (reference-only vs surface-only vs full) + H1/H2 trend analysis + perplexity pre-validation.\n      在 worst 档中，reference features 的独立贡献极低，surface features 主导信号。\n    expected_results:\n      full_macro_f1: 0.82\n      reference_only_f1: 0.58\n      surface_only_f1: 0.79\n      ref_vs_full_delta_pp: 3.0\n      surface_vs_full_delta_pp: 3.0\n      h2_features_confirmed: [\"hapax_ratio\", \"ttr\"]\n      h2_features_weak: [\"entropy_mean\"]\n      h1_features_confirmed: [\"tail_decay\", \"entropy_std\"]\n      h1_features_ambiguous: [\"entropy_min\", \"entropy_max\"]\n      entropy_mean_slope_r2: 0.41\n      ttr_slope_r2: 0.72\n      hapax_slope_r2: 0.75\n      tail_decay_slope_r2: 0.08\n      entropy_std_slope_r2: 0.05\n      ppl_depth_0: 13.5\n      ppl_depth_4: 1.7\n      ppl_signal_exists: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      在 worst 档下，Pythia-on-Pythia 的 MVP 数据本身仍表现尚可（same-family signal 不是问题），\n      但 reference features 在 ablation 中仅贡献 +3pp，暗示 entropy_mean 的 drift 信号弱于预期。\n      Surface features (TTR, hapax) 因 vocabulary impoverishment 效应主导，R² 高。\n      entropy_mean 的 R² 仅 0.41（不是强线性趋势，部分 depth 有噪声 plateau）。\n      这预示着跨家族时 reference features 将更弱——因为 drift 本身依赖 Pythia 特有的 token 分布。\n      Perplexity 仍随 depth 下降（这是 trivial 的——recursive generation 趋向 mode collapse），\n      但这不等于分类器能利用这一信号。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Feature Ablation (5-fold CV, Pythia-2.8B only)\"\n        columns: [\"Feature Set\", \"Macro F1\", \"95% CI\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Full (7 features)\", \"0.820\", \"[0.807, 0.833]\"]\n          - [\"Surface only (TTR + hapax)\", \"0.790\", \"[0.776, 0.804]\"]\n          - [\"Reference only (5 entropy + tail)\", \"0.580\", \"[0.562, 0.598]\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Feature trend plot: hapax_ratio 和 TTR 呈强单调下降 (R²>0.7)，entropy_mean 中等下降但 depth 2-3 有 plateau (R²=0.41)，tail_decay/entropy_std 水平波动 (R²<0.1)\"\n    analysis: >\n      Surface features 解释绝大部分 variance。Reference features 独立贡献低是 worst case 的早期信号：\n      如果 entropy_mean 的 drift 信号不强，跨家族泛化时这条线将进一步恶化（不同 reference model 对不同 generator 的 NLL 分布响应不一致）。\n      Plan B activated: Claim 2 需 reframe 为 \"complementary signal exists but surface features dominate\"。\n\n  - name: cross_generator_evaluation\n    plan_id: plan_002\n    description: >\n      扩展至 5 generators (Pythia-2.8B, Pythia-1B, OLMo-2-1B, Qwen3-1.7B, Qwen3-0.6B)，LOGO CV 评估。\n      Worst 档：新家族泛化能力严重不足，overall LOGO F1 被拉低到边缘水平。\n    expected_results:\n      logo_5gen_avg_f1_3class: 0.66\n      logo_binary_f1_expanded: 0.64\n      per_gen_held_out_f1:\n        pythia-2.8b: 0.78\n        pythia-1b: 0.74\n        olmo-2-1b: 0.52\n        qwen3-1.7b: 0.48\n        qwen3-0.6b: 0.45\n      per_gen_f1_std: 0.14\n      worst_single_gen_f1: 0.45\n      best_single_gen_f1: 0.78\n      leave_one_family_out:\n        pythia_held_out: 0.72\n        olmo_held_out: 0.52\n        qwen_held_out: 0.47\n      family_out_delta: 0.25\n      new_family_avg_held_out_f1: 0.48\n      spearman_by_generator:\n        pythia-2.8b:\n          hapax_ratio: -0.65\n          ttr: -0.60\n          entropy_mean: -0.55\n        pythia-1b:\n          hapax_ratio: -0.58\n          ttr: -0.52\n          entropy_mean: -0.48\n        olmo-2-1b:\n          hapax_ratio: -0.22\n          ttr: -0.18\n          entropy_mean: -0.12\n        qwen3-1.7b:\n          hapax_ratio: -0.15\n          ttr: -0.10\n          entropy_mean: -0.08\n        qwen3-0.6b:\n          hapax_ratio: -0.12\n          ttr: -0.09\n          entropy_mean: -0.05\n      seven_feat_vs_avg_logprob_pp: -0.5\n      seven_feat_vs_best_baseline_pp: 0.3\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst 档的核心假设：新家族 depth signal 极弱。Pythia 家族内部泛化良好（same tokenizer, similar training data），\n      但 OLMo/Qwen 的 depth drift 模式与 Pythia 截然不同：\n      (1) Qwen 系列使用不同 tokenizer + 大规模多语言预训练，vocabulary impoverishment 路径不同，\n          hapax_ratio/TTR 的 drift 幅度小（Spearman 仅 -0.1 到 -0.15）；\n      (2) OLMo 训练数据更干净（Dolma 数据集），recursive generation 的 mode collapse 速度慢，\n          depth 2-4 的特征分布与 depth 1 差异小；\n      (3) entropy_mean 在新家族上几乎没有 drift（Spearman > -0.12），因为 Pythia-410M reference\n          对非 Pythia 家族文本的 NLL 分布本身就高且方差大，depth 变化被淹没。\n      结果：LOGO CV 被 Qwen/OLMo 的低 held-out F1 严重拉低（0.45-0.52），overall 降至 0.64-0.66。\n      7-feature ensemble 不再优于 Avg-LogProb（因为 reference features 对新家族无效，\n      而 Avg-LogProb 至少能捕捉 perplexity 差异）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: LOGO Per-Generator Held-out F1\"\n        columns: [\"Generator\", \"3-class F1\", \"Binary F1\", \"Family\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Pythia-2.8B\", \"0.78\", \"0.76\", \"Pythia\"]\n          - [\"Pythia-1B\", \"0.74\", \"0.71\", \"Pythia\"]\n          - [\"OLMo-2-1B\", \"0.52\", \"0.50\", \"OLMo\"]\n          - [\"Qwen3-1.7B\", \"0.48\", \"0.46\", \"Qwen\"]\n          - [\"Qwen3-0.6B\", \"0.45\", \"0.43\", \"Qwen\"]\n          - [\"Average\", \"0.594\", \"0.572\", \"—\"]\n      - name: \"Table: 7-Feature vs Baselines (5-gen LOGO)\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"3-class F1\", \"Binary F1\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"7-feature ensemble\", \"0.66\", \"0.64\"]\n          - [\"Avg-LogProb\", \"0.67\", \"0.65\"]\n          - [\"LD-Score\", \"0.61\", \"0.59\"]\n          - [\"FastDetectGPT\", \"0.55\", \"0.53\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Per-generator held-out F1 bar chart: Pythia 双柱高 (0.74-0.78)，OLMo/Qwen 三柱低 (0.45-0.52)，巨大落差\"\n      - \"Feature drift heatmap by generator: Pythia 行深蓝 (strong negative ρ)，Qwen/OLMo 行浅灰 (near-zero ρ)\"\n    analysis: >\n      \"Universal phenomenon\" claim 崩塌。Depth signal 是 Pythia-specific（或 same-family-specific）现象，\n      不是 generation-intrinsic 的。7-feature ensemble 失去优势因为其核心 reference features 依赖\n      Pythia-410M 对目标文本的 NLL 分布特性，对非 Pythia 生成文本无效。\n      Paper 需 reframe：从 \"depth fingerprinting works\" 到 \"characterizing when depth signal exists\"。\n      Pythia 家族的强信号本身仍有价值（对特定 training pipeline 的诊断工具），但 universality claim 必须撤回。\n\n  - name: paraphrastic_comparison\n    plan_id: plan_006\n    description: >\n      对比 paraphrasing chains vs continuation chains。Worst 档：两者差异不显著，\n      或 paraphrastic chains 反而表现更好（违反 attractor theory 预测）。\n    expected_results:\n      paraphrastic_3class_f1: 0.62\n      paraphrastic_binary_f1: 0.58\n      continuation_3class_f1: 0.66\n      continuation_binary_f1: 0.64\n      f1_3class_delta: -0.04\n      delta_not_significant: true\n      bootstrap_p_delta: 0.18\n      spearman_entropy_mean_para: -0.28\n      spearman_entropy_mean_cont: -0.32\n      spearman_ttr_para: -0.22\n      spearman_ttr_cont: -0.25\n      cross_transfer_para_to_cont_f1: 0.55\n      cross_transfer_cont_to_para_f1: 0.52\n      depth_retention_para: 0.92\n      depth_retention_cont: 0.85\n    result_rationale: >\n      在 worst 档下（overall signal 弱），continuation 和 paraphrastic chains 的差异被压缩：\n      (1) 两者 Spearman 都弱（-0.25 到 -0.32），差异不足以达到统计显著；\n      (2) continuation 的优势（attractor theory 预测 para 会 converge）被 overall signal weakness 掩盖——\n          如果信号本身就弱，两种 chain type 的差异也小；\n      (3) Cross-transfer F1 仅 0.52-0.55（略高于 chance），说明两种 chain 的 feature 模式不同，\n          但都不够强到能 transfer；\n      (4) 这否定了 \"non-paraphrastic chains preserve more depth signal\" 的 claim——\n          在新家族上两者都不 work，差异成了 noise。\n      Paper implication：不能用 para vs non-para 的对比来 justify task formulation的优越性。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Paraphrastic vs Continuation (expanded generators)\"\n        columns: [\"Chain Type\", \"3-class F1\", \"Binary F1\", \"Δ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Continuation\", \"0.66\", \"0.64\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Paraphrastic\", \"0.62\", \"0.58\", \"-0.04 / -0.06\"]\n          - [\"Bootstrap p-value\", \"—\", \"—\", \"0.18 (n.s.)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Paired comparison plot: continuation 和 paraphrastic 的 per-generator F1 散点图，大部分点聚集在 diagonal 附近，差异不系统性\"\n    analysis: >\n      Attractor theory 的 prediction 未被有力验证——差异存在但不显著。\n      在 worst 档叙事中，这变成 \"depth signal 的存在本身是 family-specific 的，\n      chain type 的影响是 second-order effect\"。\n      Paper 可以诚实报告这一 null result，作为 boundary characterization 的一部分。\n\n  - name: finer_grained_ordinal\n    plan_id: plan_009\n    description: >\n      5-class ordinal classification (gen-0 through gen-4)。\n      Worst 档：5-class 退化至接近 random，确认深层 depth 不可分辨。\n    expected_results:\n      5class_macro_f1: 0.35\n      5class_accuracy: 0.38\n      5class_mae: 1.12\n      3class_macro_f1: 0.66\n      delta_5class_vs_3class: -0.31\n      per_class_f1:\n        depth_0: 0.72\n        depth_1: 0.38\n        depth_2: 0.22\n        depth_3: 0.18\n        depth_4: 0.25\n      gen2_gen3_inseparable: true\n      gen1_gen2_inseparable: true\n      confusion_matrix_pattern: \"depth 1-3 互相混淆严重，depth 0 可分但精度下降，depth 4 有微弱信号\"\n      ordinal_methods_vs_xgboost:\n        coral_5class: 0.33\n        frank_hall_5class: 0.34\n        xgboost_5class: 0.35\n    result_rationale: >\n      在 worst 档下，even 3-class 的 binary F1 已降至 0.64，5-class 进一步要求区分 gen-1/gen-2/gen-3/gen-4——\n      这些 depth 之间的 feature 差异极小（新家族的 drift slope 本身就近乎 flat）。\n      (1) Depth 0 尚可分辨（0.72）因为 human seed 与 LLM output 仍有 systematic 差异；\n      (2) Depth 1-3 完全混淆（F1 0.18-0.38）——drift 不单调或幅度太小；\n      (3) Depth 4 有微弱信号（0.25）可能因为极深生成偶尔出现 repetition/degeneration artifacts；\n      (4) 5-class MAE > 1.0 意味着平均预测误差超过 1 个 depth level，实用价值为零。\n      结论：finer-grained classification 在 worst 档下不可行，支持 paper reframe 为\n      \"boundary characterization\"——明确指出 3-class 是 ceiling。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Ordinal Classification Granularity\"\n        columns: [\"Granularity\", \"Macro F1\", \"MAE\", \"Method\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Binary (gen-1 vs gen-2+)\", \"0.64\", \"—\", \"XGBoost\"]\n          - [\"3-class (gen-0/1/2+)\", \"0.66\", \"0.52\", \"XGBoost\"]\n          - [\"5-class (gen-0..4)\", \"0.35\", \"1.12\", \"XGBoost\"]\n          - [\"5-class CORAL\", \"0.33\", \"1.08\", \"CORAL\"]\n          - [\"5-class Frank-Hall\", \"0.34\", \"1.10\", \"Frank-Hall\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"5-class confusion matrix heatmap: 对角线仅 depth-0 有明显集中，depth 1-3 区域为均匀分布色块\"\n    analysis: >\n      5-class 结果彻底确认 depth resolution 上限。在 worst 档下，even binary (gen-1 vs gen-2+)\n      已经挣扎，5-class 完全不可行。这为 reframe 提供数据支撑：\n      \"generation depth is discriminable at coarse granularity under specific conditions,\n      but finer ordinal resolution exceeds the information content of distributional features.\"\n\n  - name: end_to_end_classifier\n    plan_id: plan_012\n    description: >\n      QLoRA fine-tuned Qwen3.5-0.8B for end-to-end depth classification。\n      Worst 档：learned representations 不显著优于 handcrafted features（或仅在 same-family 上优），\n      跨家族同样失败。\n    expected_results:\n      e2e_5class_macro_f1: 0.42\n      e2e_3class_macro_f1: 0.71\n      e2e_binary_f1: 0.68\n      xgboost_7feat_3class_f1: 0.66\n      e2e_vs_xgboost_delta_3class_pp: 5.0\n      e2e_logo_cross_family_f1: 0.48\n      e2e_per_generator:\n        pythia-2.8b: 0.78\n        pythia-1b: 0.75\n        olmo-2-1b: 0.55\n        qwen3-1.7b: 0.49\n        qwen3-0.6b: 0.46\n      overfitting_gap: 0.18\n      train_f1: 0.89\n      val_f1: 0.71\n    result_rationale: >\n      End-to-end model 有更多参数来拟合 training distribution，但在 worst 档下：\n      (1) Same-family generators (Pythia) 上 E2E 优于 XGBoost（+5pp），\n          因为 learned representations 能捕捉 Pythia-specific 的 depth pattern；\n      (2) Cross-family 上 E2E 同样失败（0.48-0.55），因为 depth signal 本身不存在于这些家族——\n          no amount of representation learning 能 extract 不存在的信号；\n      (3) 明显 overfitting（train 0.89 vs val 0.71），E2E 模型学到了 training generators 的\n          spurious correlations 而非 generalizable depth features；\n      (4) 这强化了 worst 档叙事：问题不在方法（handcrafted vs learned），\n          而在于 depth signal 本身的 family-specificity。\n      Paper framing: \"Neither handcrafted distributional features nor learned representations\n      achieve reliable cross-family depth estimation, suggesting the signal itself is\n      family-dependent rather than a methodological limitation.\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: E2E vs Handcrafted Features\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Same-family F1\", \"Cross-family F1\", \"Gap\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"QLoRA Qwen3-0.6B\", \"0.76\", \"0.48\", \"0.28\"]\n          - [\"XGBoost 7-feature\", \"0.76\", \"0.47\", \"0.29\"]\n          - [\"Avg-LogProb only\", \"0.72\", \"0.49\", \"0.23\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Learning curve plot: training F1 持续上升至 0.89，validation F1 在 epoch 3 后 plateau 于 0.71 并微降——overfitting\"\n      - \"Cross-family transfer heatmap: 对角线（same-family）深色，off-diagonal（cross-family）浅色，E2E 和 XGBoost 模式几乎相同\"\n    analysis: >\n      E2E 结果是 worst 档叙事的 strongest evidence：如果 700M 参数的 fine-tuned LM 都不能\n      cross-family generalize，那问题 definitively 不是 feature engineering 的限制，\n      而是 depth signal 本身的 boundary。\n      这成为 paper 的 key contribution 之一：\"systematic evidence that generation depth\n      discriminability is bounded by model family, not methodology.\"\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":28817,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":28817},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2e4b40ca-b05e-4e60-a577-cc09f4391152","uuid":"1d999134-8c9e-4e5f-bf8d-cb3fc4b88a73"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":136791,"duration_api_ms":138663,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  核心 \"universal differential response\" framing 不成立。多数新家族 depth signal 极弱或模式不一致。\n  Reframe 为 \"On the Limits of Generation Depth Estimation\" —— 条件分析（何时有效/何时失败）本身就是贡献。\n  Paper 从 method paper 转为 empirical boundary study。EMNLP weak accept 区间，靠 writing 和 negative finding 叙事支撑。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: feature_ablation_and_trend\n    plan_id: plan_001\n    description: >\n      Feature ablation (reference-only vs surface-only vs full) + H1/H2 trend analysis + perplexity pre-validation.\n      在 worst 档中，reference features 的独立贡献极低，surface features 主导信号。\n    expected_results:\n      full_macro_f1: 0.82\n      reference_only_f1: 0.58\n      surface_only_f1: 0.79\n      ref_vs_full_delta_pp: 3.0\n      surface_vs_full_delta_pp: 3.0\n      h2_features_confirmed: [\"hapax_ratio\", \"ttr\"]\n      h2_features_weak: [\"entropy_mean\"]\n      h1_features_confirmed: [\"tail_decay\", \"entropy_std\"]\n      h1_features_ambiguous: [\"entropy_min\", \"entropy_max\"]\n      entropy_mean_slope_r2: 0.41\n      ttr_slope_r2: 0.72\n      hapax_slope_r2: 0.75\n      tail_decay_slope_r2: 0.08\n      entropy_std_slope_r2: 0.05\n      ppl_depth_0: 13.5\n      ppl_depth_4: 1.7\n      ppl_signal_exists: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      在 worst 档下，Pythia-on-Pythia 的 MVP 数据本身仍表现尚可（same-family signal 不是问题），\n      但 reference features 在 ablation 中仅贡献 +3pp，暗示 entropy_mean 的 drift 信号弱于预期。\n      Surface features (TTR, hapax) 因 vocabulary impoverishment 效应主导，R² 高。\n      entropy_mean 的 R² 仅 0.41（不是强线性趋势，部分 depth 有噪声 plateau）。\n      这预示着跨家族时 reference features 将更弱——因为 drift 本身依赖 Pythia 特有的 token 分布。\n      Perplexity 仍随 depth 下降（这是 trivial 的——recursive generation 趋向 mode collapse），\n      但这不等于分类器能利用这一信号。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Feature Ablation (5-fold CV, Pythia-2.8B only)\"\n        columns: [\"Feature Set\", \"Macro F1\", \"95% CI\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Full (7 features)\", \"0.820\", \"[0.807, 0.833]\"]\n          - [\"Surface only (TTR + hapax)\", \"0.790\", \"[0.776, 0.804]\"]\n          - [\"Reference only (5 entropy + tail)\", \"0.580\", \"[0.562, 0.598]\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Feature trend plot: hapax_ratio 和 TTR 呈强单调下降 (R²>0.7)，entropy_mean 中等下降但 depth 2-3 有 plateau (R²=0.41)，tail_decay/entropy_std 水平波动 (R²<0.1)\"\n    analysis: >\n      Surface features 解释绝大部分 variance。Reference features 独立贡献低是 worst case 的早期信号：\n      如果 entropy_mean 的 drift 信号不强，跨家族泛化时这条线将进一步恶化（不同 reference model 对不同 generator 的 NLL 分布响应不一致）。\n      Plan B activated: Claim 2 需 reframe 为 \"complementary signal exists but surface features dominate\"。\n\n  - name: cross_generator_evaluation\n    plan_id: plan_002\n    description: >\n      扩展至 5 generators (Pythia-2.8B, Pythia-1B, OLMo-2-1B, Qwen3-1.7B, Qwen3-0.6B)，LOGO CV 评估。\n      Worst 档：新家族泛化能力严重不足，overall LOGO F1 被拉低到边缘水平。\n    expected_results:\n      logo_5gen_avg_f1_3class: 0.66\n      logo_binary_f1_expanded: 0.64\n      per_gen_held_out_f1:\n        pythia-2.8b: 0.78\n        pythia-1b: 0.74\n        olmo-2-1b: 0.52\n        qwen3-1.7b: 0.48\n        qwen3-0.6b: 0.45\n      per_gen_f1_std: 0.14\n      worst_single_gen_f1: 0.45\n      best_single_gen_f1: 0.78\n      leave_one_family_out:\n        pythia_held_out: 0.72\n        olmo_held_out: 0.52\n        qwen_held_out: 0.47\n      family_out_delta: 0.25\n      new_family_avg_held_out_f1: 0.48\n      spearman_by_generator:\n        pythia-2.8b:\n          hapax_ratio: -0.65\n          ttr: -0.60\n          entropy_mean: -0.55\n        pythia-1b:\n          hapax_ratio: -0.58\n          ttr: -0.52\n          entropy_mean: -0.48\n        olmo-2-1b:\n          hapax_ratio: -0.22\n          ttr: -0.18\n          entropy_mean: -0.12\n        qwen3-1.7b:\n          hapax_ratio: -0.15\n          ttr: -0.10\n          entropy_mean: -0.08\n        qwen3-0.6b:\n          hapax_ratio: -0.12\n          ttr: -0.09\n          entropy_mean: -0.05\n      seven_feat_vs_avg_logprob_pp: -0.5\n      seven_feat_vs_best_baseline_pp: 0.3\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst 档的核心假设：新家族 depth signal 极弱。Pythia 家族内部泛化良好（same tokenizer, similar training data），\n      但 OLMo/Qwen 的 depth drift 模式与 Pythia 截然不同：\n      (1) Qwen 系列使用不同 tokenizer + 大规模多语言预训练，vocabulary impoverishment 路径不同，\n          hapax_ratio/TTR 的 drift 幅度小（Spearman 仅 -0.1 到 -0.15）；\n      (2) OLMo 训练数据更干净（Dolma 数据集），recursive generation 的 mode collapse 速度慢，\n          depth 2-4 的特征分布与 depth 1 差异小；\n      (3) entropy_mean 在新家族上几乎没有 drift（Spearman > -0.12），因为 Pythia-410M reference\n          对非 Pythia 家族文本的 NLL 分布本身就高且方差大，depth 变化被淹没。\n      结果：LOGO CV 被 Qwen/OLMo 的低 held-out F1 严重拉低（0.45-0.52），overall 降至 0.64-0.66。\n      7-feature ensemble 不再优于 Avg-LogProb（因为 reference features 对新家族无效，\n      而 Avg-LogProb 至少能捕捉 perplexity 差异）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: LOGO Per-Generator Held-out F1\"\n        columns: [\"Generator\", \"3-class F1\", \"Binary F1\", \"Family\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Pythia-2.8B\", \"0.78\", \"0.76\", \"Pythia\"]\n          - [\"Pythia-1B\", \"0.74\", \"0.71\", \"Pythia\"]\n          - [\"OLMo-2-1B\", \"0.52\", \"0.50\", \"OLMo\"]\n          - [\"Qwen3-1.7B\", \"0.48\", \"0.46\", \"Qwen\"]\n          - [\"Qwen3-0.6B\", \"0.45\", \"0.43\", \"Qwen\"]\n          - [\"Average\", \"0.594\", \"0.572\", \"—\"]\n      - name: \"Table: 7-Feature vs Baselines (5-gen LOGO)\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"3-class F1\", \"Binary F1\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"7-feature ensemble\", \"0.66\", \"0.64\"]\n          - [\"Avg-LogProb\", \"0.67\", \"0.65\"]\n          - [\"LD-Score\", \"0.61\", \"0.59\"]\n          - [\"FastDetectGPT\", \"0.55\", \"0.53\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Per-generator held-out F1 bar chart: Pythia 双柱高 (0.74-0.78)，OLMo/Qwen 三柱低 (0.45-0.52)，巨大落差\"\n      - \"Feature drift heatmap by generator: Pythia 行深蓝 (strong negative ρ)，Qwen/OLMo 行浅灰 (near-zero ρ)\"\n    analysis: >\n      \"Universal phenomenon\" claim 崩塌。Depth signal 是 Pythia-specific（或 same-family-specific）现象，\n      不是 generation-intrinsic 的。7-feature ensemble 失去优势因为其核心 reference features 依赖\n      Pythia-410M 对目标文本的 NLL 分布特性，对非 Pythia 生成文本无效。\n      Paper 需 reframe：从 \"depth fingerprinting works\" 到 \"characterizing when depth signal exists\"。\n      Pythia 家族的强信号本身仍有价值（对特定 training pipeline 的诊断工具），但 universality claim 必须撤回。\n\n  - name: paraphrastic_comparison\n    plan_id: plan_006\n    description: >\n      对比 paraphrasing chains vs continuation chains。Worst 档：两者差异不显著，\n      或 paraphrastic chains 反而表现更好（违反 attractor theory 预测）。\n    expected_results:\n      paraphrastic_3class_f1: 0.62\n      paraphrastic_binary_f1: 0.58\n      continuation_3class_f1: 0.66\n      continuation_binary_f1: 0.64\n      f1_3class_delta: -0.04\n      delta_not_significant: true\n      bootstrap_p_delta: 0.18\n      spearman_entropy_mean_para: -0.28\n      spearman_entropy_mean_cont: -0.32\n      spearman_ttr_para: -0.22\n      spearman_ttr_cont: -0.25\n      cross_transfer_para_to_cont_f1: 0.55\n      cross_transfer_cont_to_para_f1: 0.52\n      depth_retention_para: 0.92\n      depth_retention_cont: 0.85\n    result_rationale: >\n      在 worst 档下（overall signal 弱），continuation 和 paraphrastic chains 的差异被压缩：\n      (1) 两者 Spearman 都弱（-0.25 到 -0.32），差异不足以达到统计显著；\n      (2) continuation 的优势（attractor theory 预测 para 会 converge）被 overall signal weakness 掩盖——\n          如果信号本身就弱，两种 chain type 的差异也小；\n      (3) Cross-transfer F1 仅 0.52-0.55（略高于 chance），说明两种 chain 的 feature 模式不同，\n          但都不够强到能 transfer；\n      (4) 这否定了 \"non-paraphrastic chains preserve more depth signal\" 的 claim——\n          在新家族上两者都不 work，差异成了 noise。\n      Paper implication：不能用 para vs non-para 的对比来 justify task formulation的优越性。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Paraphrastic vs Continuation (expanded generators)\"\n        columns: [\"Chain Type\", \"3-class F1\", \"Binary F1\", \"Δ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Continuation\", \"0.66\", \"0.64\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Paraphrastic\", \"0.62\", \"0.58\", \"-0.04 / -0.06\"]\n          - [\"Bootstrap p-value\", \"—\", \"—\", \"0.18 (n.s.)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Paired comparison plot: continuation 和 paraphrastic 的 per-generator F1 散点图，大部分点聚集在 diagonal 附近，差异不系统性\"\n    analysis: >\n      Attractor theory 的 prediction 未被有力验证——差异存在但不显著。\n      在 worst 档叙事中，这变成 \"depth signal 的存在本身是 family-specific 的，\n      chain type 的影响是 second-order effect\"。\n      Paper 可以诚实报告这一 null result，作为 boundary characterization 的一部分。\n\n  - name: finer_grained_ordinal\n    plan_id: plan_009\n    description: >\n      5-class ordinal classification (gen-0 through gen-4)。\n      Worst 档：5-class 退化至接近 random，确认深层 depth 不可分辨。\n    expected_results:\n      5class_macro_f1: 0.35\n      5class_accuracy: 0.38\n      5class_mae: 1.12\n      3class_macro_f1: 0.66\n      delta_5class_vs_3class: -0.31\n      per_class_f1:\n        depth_0: 0.72\n        depth_1: 0.38\n        depth_2: 0.22\n        depth_3: 0.18\n        depth_4: 0.25\n      gen2_gen3_inseparable: true\n      gen1_gen2_inseparable: true\n      confusion_matrix_pattern: \"depth 1-3 互相混淆严重，depth 0 可分但精度下降，depth 4 有微弱信号\"\n      ordinal_methods_vs_xgboost:\n        coral_5class: 0.33\n        frank_hall_5class: 0.34\n        xgboost_5class: 0.35\n    result_rationale: >\n      在 worst 档下，even 3-class 的 binary F1 已降至 0.64，5-class 进一步要求区分 gen-1/gen-2/gen-3/gen-4——\n      这些 depth 之间的 feature 差异极小（新家族的 drift slope 本身就近乎 flat）。\n      (1) Depth 0 尚可分辨（0.72）因为 human seed 与 LLM output 仍有 systematic 差异；\n      (2) Depth 1-3 完全混淆（F1 0.18-0.38）——drift 不单调或幅度太小；\n      (3) Depth 4 有微弱信号（0.25）可能因为极深生成偶尔出现 repetition/degeneration artifacts；\n      (4) 5-class MAE > 1.0 意味着平均预测误差超过 1 个 depth level，实用价值为零。\n      结论：finer-grained classification 在 worst 档下不可行，支持 paper reframe 为\n      \"boundary characterization\"——明确指出 3-class 是 ceiling。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Ordinal Classification Granularity\"\n        columns: [\"Granularity\", \"Macro F1\", \"MAE\", \"Method\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Binary (gen-1 vs gen-2+)\", \"0.64\", \"—\", \"XGBoost\"]\n          - [\"3-class (gen-0/1/2+)\", \"0.66\", \"0.52\", \"XGBoost\"]\n          - [\"5-class (gen-0..4)\", \"0.35\", \"1.12\", \"XGBoost\"]\n          - [\"5-class CORAL\", \"0.33\", \"1.08\", \"CORAL\"]\n          - [\"5-class Frank-Hall\", \"0.34\", \"1.10\", \"Frank-Hall\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"5-class confusion matrix heatmap: 对角线仅 depth-0 有明显集中，depth 1-3 区域为均匀分布色块\"\n    analysis: >\n      5-class 结果彻底确认 depth resolution 上限。在 worst 档下，even binary (gen-1 vs gen-2+)\n      已经挣扎，5-class 完全不可行。这为 reframe 提供数据支撑：\n      \"generation depth is discriminable at coarse granularity under specific conditions,\n      but finer ordinal resolution exceeds the information content of distributional features.\"\n\n  - name: end_to_end_classifier\n    plan_id: plan_012\n    description: >\n      QLoRA fine-tuned Qwen3.5-0.8B for end-to-end depth classification。\n      Worst 档：learned representations 不显著优于 handcrafted features（或仅在 same-family 上优），\n      跨家族同样失败。\n    expected_results:\n      e2e_5class_macro_f1: 0.42\n      e2e_3class_macro_f1: 0.71\n      e2e_binary_f1: 0.68\n      xgboost_7feat_3class_f1: 0.66\n      e2e_vs_xgboost_delta_3class_pp: 5.0\n      e2e_logo_cross_family_f1: 0.48\n      e2e_per_generator:\n        pythia-2.8b: 0.78\n        pythia-1b: 0.75\n        olmo-2-1b: 0.55\n        qwen3-1.7b: 0.49\n        qwen3-0.6b: 0.46\n      overfitting_gap: 0.18\n      train_f1: 0.89\n      val_f1: 0.71\n    result_rationale: >\n      End-to-end model 有更多参数来拟合 training distribution，但在 worst 档下：\n      (1) Same-family generators (Pythia) 上 E2E 优于 XGBoost（+5pp），\n          因为 learned representations 能捕捉 Pythia-specific 的 depth pattern；\n      (2) Cross-family 上 E2E 同样失败（0.48-0.55），因为 depth signal 本身不存在于这些家族——\n          no amount of representation learning 能 extract 不存在的信号；\n      (3) 明显 overfitting（train 0.89 vs val 0.71），E2E 模型学到了 training generators 的\n          spurious correlations 而非 generalizable depth features；\n      (4) 这强化了 worst 档叙事：问题不在方法（handcrafted vs learned），\n          而在于 depth signal 本身的 family-specificity。\n      Paper framing: \"Neither handcrafted distributional features nor learned representations\n      achieve reliable cross-family depth estimation, suggesting the signal itself is\n      family-dependent rather than a methodological limitation.\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: E2E vs Handcrafted Features\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Same-family F1\", \"Cross-family F1\", \"Gap\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"QLoRA Qwen3-0.6B\", \"0.76\", \"0.48\", \"0.28\"]\n          - [\"XGBoost 7-feature\", \"0.76\", \"0.47\", \"0.29\"]\n          - [\"Avg-LogProb only\", \"0.72\", \"0.49\", \"0.23\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Learning curve plot: training F1 持续上升至 0.89，validation F1 在 epoch 3 后 plateau 于 0.71 并微降——overfitting\"\n      - \"Cross-family transfer heatmap: 对角线（same-family）深色，off-diagonal（cross-family）浅色，E2E 和 XGBoost 模式几乎相同\"\n    analysis: >\n      E2E 结果是 worst 档叙事的 strongest evidence：如果 700M 参数的 fine-tuned LM 都不能\n      cross-family generalize，那问题 definitively 不是 feature engineering 的限制，\n      而是 depth signal 本身的 boundary。\n      这成为 paper 的 key contribution 之一：\"systematic evidence that generation depth\n      discriminability is bounded by model family, not methodology.\"\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"2e4b40ca-b05e-4e60-a577-cc09f4391152","total_cost_usd":0.38748175,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":28817,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":7103,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":28817,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{